@startuml 3.4.10 - List Workspace
title Sequence Diagram — 3.4.10 - List Workspace

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
actor "User (any role)" as user_any_role
boundary "WorkspacePage (UI)" as workspacepage_ui
boundary "WorkspaceController" as workspacecontroller
control "WorkspaceServiceImpl" as workspaceserviceimpl
entity "AgencyRepository" as agencyrepository
entity "WorkspaceRepository" as workspacerepository
entity "WorkspaceMemberRepository" as workspacememberrepository
entity "ClientProfileRepository" as clientprofilerepository
entity "Workspace" as workspace
entity "WorkspaceResponse" as workspaceresponse

' === Flow 1 ===
note over user_any_role, workspaceresponse : == LUỒNG 1: XEM TẤT CẢ WORKSPACE NGƯỜI DÙNG THAM GIA HOẶC SỞ HỮU ==\nNgười dùng xem danh sách Workspaces thuộc về mình hoặc được sở hữu thông qua Agency

user_any_role -> workspacepage_ui: opens Workspace list screen
workspacepage_ui -> workspacecontroller: GET /api/v1/workspaces
workspacecontroller -> workspaceserviceimpl: listWorkspaces(currentUser)
workspaceserviceimpl -> agencyrepository: findByOwnerIdAndStatusNot(userId, SOFT_DELETED)
agencyrepository --> workspaceserviceimpl: List<Agency>
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspacerepository: findByAgencyId(agencyId) - per owned agency
workspacerepository --> workspaceserviceimpl: List<Workspace> -> ownerWorkspaceIds
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspacememberrepository: findByUserIdAndIsActiveTrue(userId)
workspacememberrepository --> workspaceserviceimpl: List<WorkspaceMember> -> memberRoleByWorkspaceId
workspaceserviceimpl -> clientprofilerepository: findByUserId(userId) - resolve caller's ClientProfile ids
clientprofilerepository --> workspaceserviceimpl: List<ClientProfile>
opt caller has ClientProfile ids
  workspaceserviceimpl -> workspacememberrepository: findByClientProfileIdInAndIsActiveTrue(clientProfileIds)
  workspacememberrepository --> workspaceserviceimpl: List<WorkspaceMember> - merge CLIENT rows
  workspaceserviceimpl -> workspaceserviceimpl: merge ownerWorkspaceIds + memberRoleByWorkspaceId.keySet() -> workspaceIds (LinkedHashSet)
  workspaceserviceimpl -> workspacerepository: findAllById(workspaceIds) - NO status filter
end
workspacerepository --> workspaceserviceimpl: List<Workspace>
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspace: map row -> Workspace
workspace --> workspaceserviceimpl: Workspace
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspaceresponse: toResponse(ws, role, clientProfileId) - OWNER role wins if ownerWorkspaceIds contains id
workspaceresponse --> workspaceserviceimpl: WorkspaceResponse
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspacecontroller: List<WorkspaceResponse>
workspacecontroller --> workspacepage_ui: 200 OK List<WorkspaceResponse>
workspacepage_ui -> user_any_role: renders Workspace list (empty state if none)

' === Flow 2 ===
note over user_any_role, workspaceresponse : == LUỒNG 2: XEM DANH SÁCH WORKSPACE DO NGƯỜI DÙNG QUẢN LÝ (WORKSPACES I MANAGE) ==\nNgười dùng lọc và xem danh sách các Workspace mà mình đóng vai trò MANAGER

user_any_role -> workspacepage_ui: opens \"Workspaces I Manage\" tab
workspacepage_ui -> workspacecontroller: GET /api/v1/workspaces/my-managed
workspacecontroller -> workspaceserviceimpl: listMyManagedWorkspaces(currentUser)
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspacememberrepository: findByUserIdAndIsActiveTrue(userId)
workspacememberrepository --> workspaceserviceimpl: List<WorkspaceMember>
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspaceserviceimpl: filter role == MANAGER
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspacerepository: findAllById(managedWorkspaceIds)
workspacerepository --> workspaceserviceimpl: Map<UUID, Workspace>
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspacememberrepository: countByWorkspaceIdAndIsActiveTrue(workspaceId) - per managed workspace
workspacememberrepository --> workspaceserviceimpl: long memberCount
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspaceresponse: new ManagedWorkspaceResponse(id, name, role, memberCount)
workspaceresponse --> workspaceserviceimpl: ManagedWorkspaceResponse
workspaceserviceimpl -> workspacecontroller: List<ManagedWorkspaceResponse>
workspacecontroller --> workspacepage_ui: 200 OK List<ManagedWorkspaceResponse>
workspacepage_ui -> user_any_role: renders managed Workspaces with member count badge

@enduml